{"id":"638575907","kind":"article","title":"将助记媒介看作更深入理解文本的手段会怎么样？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8ByVmn3qYHQmkzLRGN1958M1aYLZ2yzLbvGs"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-06-21","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":531,"keywords":["助记媒介","阅读理解","深度阅读","记忆卡片","主动阅读"],"summary":"译文提出，助记媒介不应只用卡片帮助记住平台知识，也可把卡片改作深入理解的提示，促使读者更专心地阅读，并在时间上持续回访材料；嵌入式卡片模板还可能帮助读者自己写卡。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/638575907","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"L9tv0fg4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>将其重点放在帮助读者建立所读内容的详细记忆上。这显然对平台知识非常有帮助（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2bwNMKjXjzp9tGrK6Hm7PXpoEeNAG9M65JW6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介对于平台知识特别有价值</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>），但是详细记忆通常不是其他类型写作的主要目标。</p><p data-pid=\"2Otv3sz3\">在思考<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z57S2Fte6gAnnM1gCS2nHpH7NYAiXD8KeDfvZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介如何让读者从平台类之外的体裁中获得知识？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>时，一种方法是将卡片更少地用作建立详细记忆的手段，而更多地用作提示更深入理解的手段（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7W1Zr7wEGptA3bFYwwaPbCFLBo54xXmQLQdK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>），不仅是在阅读体验中，而且在时间上延伸（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7tjqSxGsJ53tXsGkRpchsECWcMsW3sFUw86U\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介使读者与材料保持长久联系</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"FV1kl4bv\">一种相关的潜在机制：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2GSNFzS3TRYHW1UGQhay6Y4J16BVRSwsjWZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">嵌入卡片模板可以主动辅助助记媒介读者编写卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"hoB5CebE\"><b>将想法送入你的轨道（Orbit）</b></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"N3B8ls1e\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"BWmxR4es\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 JarrettYe、校对 <span class=\"nolink\">Albert</span><br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8ByVmn3qYHQmkzLRGN1958M1aYLZ2yzLbvGs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What if the mnemonic medium were reframed as a means to engage more deeply with a text? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介对于平台知识特别有价值 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"600193719\" href=\"#/post/600193719\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642714761\" href=\"#/post/642714761\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"478084993\" href=\"#/post/478084993\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 助记媒介使读者与材料保持长久联系 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"464712237\" href=\"#/post/464712237\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 嵌入卡片模板可以主动辅助助记媒介读者编写卡片 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"452990774\" href=\"#/post/452990774\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"599394904","title":"将助记媒介应用于非技术性文章的经验教训","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"638575951","title":"强大的赋能环境注重专业用例","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":4,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"464712237","title":"助记媒介使读者与材料保持长久联系","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"478084993","title":"助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"642714761","title":"助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}